%%          cheapest as tiebreak. SA-recognisable dishes now lead every bucket. (verified: top 8 = 6×SA + 2×home, 0 foreign)
%%    FIX-3 budgetCloseRecipe: restore scroll immediately + 1 rAF (was double-rAF → visible top-flash/jump on Back).
